From: Jonas Salo <salomannen1234@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 1 Jul 2026 18:03:20 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 10/16] infiniti: ship Oplus feature flags

Declare my_product/etc/permissions/oplus.feature.android.xml in the
proprietary-files list so the Oplus feature declarations are installed.
These flags gate OEM app features such as Gallery OLive, which the
runtime feature scan reads to decide what to enable.

(cherry picked from commit 3222f4fb12343b9c685c52bee44e6ff4e41c07dd)
---
 proprietary-files.txt | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/proprietary-files.txt b/proprietary-files.txt
index 6ce30b7..8d65760 100644
--- a/proprietary-files.txt
+++ b/proprietary-files.txt
@@ -83,6 +83,8 @@ odm/etc/audio/oprec_audrec_params/oprec_record_ID99_Bypass.bin
 odm/etc/audio/oprec_audrec_params/oprec_record_ID9_HE.bin
 odm/etc/audio/oprec_audrec_params/oprec_record_calibration.bin
 
+my_product/etc/permissions/oplus.feature.android.xml:product/etc/permissions/oplus.feature.android.xml
+
 # Camera
 odm/bin/hw/vendor.oplus.hardware.cammidasservice-V1-service
 odm/etc/camera/AIAE_Models/AIAEVideoModelMain.bin
